<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/GrowthHiatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A surface inside a speleothem across which nothing was deposited. A statement about the archive: the time above and the time below it do not join up, however densely either is sampled."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/GrowthHiatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Growth Hiatus"@en .
