<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/IceCore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A cylindrical ice sample extracted by drilling from a glacier or ice sheet."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/IceCore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ice Core"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/IceCore> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/PalaeoclimateSample> .
