<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SampleSection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/PalaeoclimateSample> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A geographically identified location from which palaeoclimate  proxy material was obtained (ice-core drilling site or speleothem cave)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sampling Location"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E27_Site> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E53_Place> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SamplingLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SavitzkyGolayFilter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SavitzkyGolayFilter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Polynomial least-squares smoothing filter preserving  higher signal moments."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SavitzkyGolayFilter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Savitzky-Golay Filter"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SavitzkyGolayFilter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SmoothingMethod> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SmoothingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SmoothingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A numerical method applied to reduce high-frequency  noise in a palaeoclimate time series."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SmoothingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Smoothing Method"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SmoothingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMsci/S6_Data_Evaluation> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/Speleothem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/Speleothem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One secondary carbonate deposit whose growth records a climate signal. SISAL calls it an entity; several may come from one cave, and their isotope values are offset against one another for reasons unrelated to climate."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/Speleothem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Speleothem"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/Speleothem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/PalaeoclimateSample> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemObservation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Speleothem Observation"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemObservation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/PalaeoclimateObservation> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemSample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One sampling position along a speleothem, identified by its depth from the top. Carries the isotope measurements and the competing ages."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Speleothem Sample"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/SpeleothemSample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sample> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/UThChronology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/UThChronology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A depth-age model for a speleothem, built on U-Th dating points: the seven SISAL v3 models and the chronology as originally published. geo_lod_core.ttl names this class as the SISAL counterpart of geolod:IceCoreChronology but does not define it; defined here, so that the eight chronology individuals reach crmsci:S4_Observation through geolod:Chronology like every other class in the graph."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/UThChronology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "U-Th Chronology"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/UThChronology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/Chronology> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageChronology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageChronology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an observation to the depth-age model used."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageChronology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "age chronology"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Age in thousands of years before present (ka BP)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "age (ka BP)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMaxKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMaxKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Age at the base of the interval a value was averaged over."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMaxKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "oldest age of interval (ka BP)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMaxKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMaxKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMinKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMinKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Age at the top of the interval a value was averaged over."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMinKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "youngest age of interval (ka BP)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMinKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageMinKaBP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageKaBP> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageModel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The model that produced this age. Filtering on it is what reproduces a published figure, which was drawn from one model and not from whichever age happened to lead."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/AgeAssignment> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "age model"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/AgeModel> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyNeg_ka> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyNeg_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uncertainty of the age on the younger side, in ka. Together with geolod:ageUncertaintyPos_ka it gives the interval age minus this value to age plus the positive uncertainty."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyNeg_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/AgeAssignment> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyNeg_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "age uncertainty, younger side (ka)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyNeg_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyPos_ka> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyPos_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uncertainty of the age on the older side, in ka. Together with geolod:ageUncertaintyNeg_ka it gives the interval age minus the negative uncertainty to age plus this value."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyPos_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/AgeAssignment> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyPos_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "age uncertainty, older side (ka)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ageUncertaintyPos_ka> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Standalone motor for single analytical measurements on specimens. No CRM."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis core (SOSA-based)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A single measured/observed value of one property on one specimen."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Observation> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/DerivedValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/DerivedValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A value computed from other analyses (fraction from counts, TMAF from indices). Record inputs with prov:wasDerivedFrom."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/DerivedValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Derived Value"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/DerivedValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Method> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An analytical method concept (EPMA, LA-ICP-MS, point-counting). Bind to CHMO via skos:exactMatch."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Method"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Procedure> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Property> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Property> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A measurable property (oxide wt%, element ppm, count, %). Lives in a vocab module."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Property> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Property"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Property> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservableProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/QualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/QualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A controlled reason a result value is absent (below detection limit, not determined). Referenceable so analyses can point at the same node."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/QualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Quality Flag"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/QualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Specimen> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Specimen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A physical specimen under analysis (mineral grain, core subsample, tephra sample)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Specimen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Specimen"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Specimen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sample> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/analyte> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/analyte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The chemical entity a property quantifies (→ ChEBI)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/analyte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Property> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/analyte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "analyte"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/belowDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/belowDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True when the result lies below the detection limit of the method, so the reported value is an upper bound and not a measurement."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/belowDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/belowDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "below detection limit"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/belowDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/qualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/qualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an analysis with no numeric result to the reason for its absence."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/qualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/qualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "quality flag"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/qualityFlag> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/QualityFlag> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/sampleDepth> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/sampleDepth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Depth below core top, metres."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/sampleDepth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Specimen> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/sampleDepth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sample depth (m)"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/sampleDepth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/workingDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/workingDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uniform threshold used when instrument 3-sigma limits are unavailable (Goldstein 2003; Reed 2005)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/workingDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/Analysis> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/workingDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "working detection limit"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/analysis/workingDetectionLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/aragoniteCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/aragoniteCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Correction applied to the isotope values of the sample for aragonite, as recorded in SISAL v3 (free text)."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/aragoniteCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "aragonite correction"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/aragoniteCorrection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/archaeologicalBroaderContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/archaeologicalBroaderContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an archaeological site (crm:E27_Site) to the broader archaeological context it belongs to."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/archaeologicalBroaderContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E27_Site> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/archaeologicalBroaderContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "archaeological broader context"@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/archaeologicalBroaderContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/ArchaeologicalContext> .
