<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/assignmentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Says whether an attribute assignment is the leading reading or an alternative one (a geolod:AssignmentStatus). Used where several sources assign a value to the same thing, for example MIS stages."@en .
