<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/composedOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A record the composite is built from. SISAL keeps the relation in composite_link_entity; without it a composite looks like an ordinary speleothem whose samples come from nowhere."@en .
