<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/constrainsSpeleothem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The record this control point dates. Sits on the speleothem and not on a sample: a dating point has its own depth and rarely coincides with a sampling position."@en .
