<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/crm-bridging> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bridges external standard vocabularies (SOSA, PROV-O, GeoSPARQL, DCAT, FOAF, Dublin Core, Pleiades, fuzzy-sl) into the CIDOC-CRM family so that every instance in the geo-lod knowledge graph has a CRM-family ancestor. Required for ingestion into the NFDI4Objects Knowledge Graph."@en .
