<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-gas> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/IceCoreChronology> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-gas> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-gas> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TRS> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-gas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gas-age branch of the Antarctic Ice Core Chronology 2023. Dates the air trapped in the bubbles, which is younger than the surrounding ice."@en .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-gas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AICC2023 gas age, EPICA Dome C (ka BP)"@en .
