<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-ice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/geo-lod/IceCoreChronology> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-ice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://w3id.org/geo-lod/trs/AICC2023-ice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TRS> .
